#: ../../source/docs/common-vio-tracking-camera.rst:12
#: 109da657925c4b59959204c4d91a1f91
msgid ""
"This article explains how to setup an `Intel Realsense T265 "
"<https://store.intelrealsense.com/buy-intel-realsense-tracking-"
"camera-t265.html?_ga=2.225595998.511560227.1566178471-459370638.1562639781>`__"
" for use with ArduPilot as a substitude for a GPS allowing position control "
"modes like Loiter, PosHold, RTL, Auto to work. This method uses a python "
"script running on an RPI companion computer to send position information to "
"ArduPilot without the use of `ROS <https://www.ros.org/>`__.  The `setup "
"using ROS is here <https://ardupilot.org/dev/docs/ros-vio-tracking-"
"camera.html>`__."
msgstr ""
"本文介绍如何配置 `Intel Realsense T265 <https://store.intelrealsense.com/buy-intel-"
"realsense-tracking-"
"camera-t265.html?_ga=2.225595998.511560227.1566178471-459370638.1562639781>`__"
" 以与 ArduPilot 配合使用，作为 GPS 的替代方案，从而支持 Loiter、PosHold、RTL、Auto "
"等位置控制模式。该方案使用运行在 RPI 伴飞电脑上的 Python 脚本向 ArduPilot 发送位置信息，无需使用 `ROS "
"<https://www.ros.org/>`__。`使用 ROS 的配置方法见此 "
"<https://ardupilot.org/dev/docs/ros-vio-tracking-camera.html>`__。"

