#: ../../source/docs/common-vio-tracking-camera.rst:24
#: 6db61149ca9b4bcfb1cf47d5066e378e 7229a1c6ef9142d8b8bacfc80a26a414
#: b759350777a94c66a7e94e7829bb2929 f49a02dbf6264db5a85e38b8d6934237
#: fce8c94e5e8749c7bc6ce4045a278df6
msgid ""
"The RPI4 supports USB3 which allows both **pose** + **image** data to be "
"captured from the camera.  The slower RPI3 only has USB2 meaning only "
"**pose** data can be captured although this is sufficient for most users."
msgstr ""
"RPI4 支持 USB3，可同时从相机采集 **位姿** 和 **图像** 数据。速度较慢的 RPI3 仅支持 USB2，只能采集 **位姿** "
"数据，但对大多数用户已足够。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-vio-tracking-camera.rst:27
#: 1612f7d8172e467eb6ac214953cbe564 5e4f4bb329b74431bb7e4a79ef613442
#: a0526d404d61469eaa96e6fb8d564a21 a21facd0593246af9889d29bbcf18457
#: a2ca2bdf35fe4f02877dcbc0e2b65a87
msgid "Hardware Setup"
msgstr "硬件配置"

#: ../../source/docs/common-vio-tracking-camera.rst:33
#: 1be73c26fb9647de9e218fd2b0cfe23d 9394c0ee57684e8daed7ba47c97ed02a
#: b13a557c501845ff8cd91af21416ac12 b58fb3a1eafb494cbe3e3a211042e3be
#: f525364b7d2b4e189bae79a52a6f7ac9
msgid ""
"Download the latest APSync Ubuntu image (`found here "
"<https://firmware.ardupilot.org/Companion/apsync/apsync-rpi-"
"ubuntu-t265-latest.img.xz>`__) to your PC and then flash it to the 16GB (or "
"larger) SD card using a tool such as `Etcher "
"<https://www.balena.io/etcher/>`__ or `Win32DiskImager "
"<https://sourceforge.net/projects/win32diskimager/>`__ and then insert it "
"into the RPI's SD Card slot"
msgstr ""
"在电脑上下载最新的 APSync Ubuntu 镜像（`从此处获取 "
"<https://firmware.ardupilot.org/Companion/apsync/apsync-rpi-"
"ubuntu-t265-latest.img.xz>`__），然后使用 `Etcher "
"<https://www.balena.io/etcher/>`__ 或 `Win32DiskImager "
"<https://sourceforge.net/projects/win32diskimager/>`__ 等工具将其烧录到 16GB（或更大）SD "
"卡，再将 SD 卡插入 RPI 的卡槽"

#: ../../source/docs/common-vio-tracking-camera.rst:34
#: 3915d1e063c941e494558fa8ec1d1423 4cdeaff6658f477986df6d0416194577
#: c18a3e10599c433db1ea4461591ba215 cc54647f1adc4229bb520520493a14a5
#: db100bf035b24112bc20571ad9baf26f
msgid ""
"Mount the Intel RealSense T265 on the vehicle facing forward (see below for "
"information other orientations) using thick double sided tape or `David "
"Sastre's T265 mount "
"<https://www.dropbox.com/s/e3ias30czsn2q4t/Intel_RealSense_Tracking_Camera_T265_holder.STL?dl=0>`__"
" to better isolate the camera from vibrations"
msgstr ""
"使用厚双面胶或 `David Sastre 的 T265 支架 "
"<https://www.dropbox.com/s/e3ias30czsn2q4t/Intel_RealSense_Tracking_Camera_T265_holder.STL?dl=0>`__"
" 将 Intel RealSense T265 朝前安装在飞行器上（其他安装方向的信息见下文），以更好地隔离相机震动"

#: ../../source/docs/common-vio-tracking-camera.rst:35
