"Connect the Intel RealSense T265's USB cable to one of the RPI4's blue USB3 "
"ports"
msgstr "将 Intel RealSense T265 的 USB 线连接到 RPI4 的蓝色 USB3 端口之一"

#: ../../source/docs/common-vio-tracking-camera.rst:36
