msgstr "将 PiConnectLite 的电源线连接到电池（7V 至 30V）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-vio-tracking-camera.rst:37
#: 6b579a434d4741dc8e1d1ea71e634e4b 6d9a3c8189f041d8a1cb152aca4165f7
