#: 1124462dee5345d899a28fdb366bf9cd 1d54f6509ff24b02994c149ab625fcdb
#: c501a6b00a4347ae96fb4322207843f1
msgid ""
":ref:`RC7_OPTION <RC7_OPTION>` = 80 (Viso Align) to allow the pilot to re-"
"align the camera's yaw with the AHRS/EKF yaw before flight with auxiliary "
"switch 7.  Re-aligning yaw before takeoff is a good idea or loss of position"
" control (aka \"toilet bowling\") may occur."
msgstr ""
":ref:`RC7_OPTION <RC7_OPTION>` = 80（Viso Align），允许飞手在飞行前通过辅助开关 7 将相机偏航与 "
"AHRS/EKF 偏航重新对齐。起飞前重新对齐偏航是个好习惯，否则可能出现位置控制失效（即「马桶效应」）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-vio-tracking-camera.rst:74
