#: e0102876652b4c0c88ab6a51f789b6af
msgid ""
"After the parameters are modified, reboot the autopilot.  Connect with the "
"ground station and (if using Mission Planner) right-mouse-button-click on "
"the map, select \"Set Home Here\", \"Set EKF Origin Here\" to tell ArduPilot"
" where the vehicle is and it should instantly appear on the map."
msgstr ""
"参数修改完成后，重启飞控。连接地面站（如使用 Mission Planner），右键单击地图，选择「Set Home Here」、「Set EKF "
"Origin Here」，告知 ArduPilot 飞行器的位置，飞行器应立即出现在地图上。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-vio-tracking-camera.rst:76
#: 01b0c3fa71934c469680854d14f68167 51873eabbf374e6db9d8e6b5b6b42da8
