#: d496b1aaf160496cacf544949e6325d2
msgid ""
"Just before flying, pick up the vehicle to a height of 1m and then put it "
"down again.  This allows the camera to calibrate its vertical scaling."
msgstr "飞行前，将飞行器抬至 1 米高再放下，使相机校准其垂直比例缩放。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-vio-tracking-camera.rst:78
#: 1ff24d80da16478b8d818219462f9203 5b2cac1497034488b56b454c62552b8d
