msgstr "开机自启"

#: ../../source/docs/common-vio-tracking-camera.rst:287
#: 066b8b4d9b4d44e9bb3d50e851552ee7 7da13a0bf38e426ca3708b46a5e5d82e
#: 84a0b16ec5f14543ae0e59eb78f173ef 9d4da82b3c4a43afa1b12fd223ea6555
#: ad4e29c345854735a39dcfddb107ce69
msgid "The script can be run automatically at boot time."
msgstr "脚本可在开机时自动运行。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-vio-tracking-camera.rst:289
#: 0557c19ba9f3484eae8c2c5df88e374e 0983220827a4455d8f2f67fe06938f26
#: 1a801f796aee4b33afcf0b4215b91d1b ba0c17ab3ee54a368a6fb23d52d01906
#: cc6d9b211e7f41d3aa5bbb01e6903937
msgid ""
"Download or create a shell file ``t265.sh``, modify the path to "
"`t265_to_mavlink.py` script in this shell file, then make it executable:"
msgstr "下载或创建 shell 文件 ``t265.sh``，修改其中 `t265_to_mavlink.py` 脚本的路径，然后添加可执行权限："

#: ../../source/docs/common-vio-tracking-camera.rst:305
#: 21c4a9addfed4889a8bb1ac18176779d 49b5b4fd81b34131a6573c3a8d1895a9
#: 9363790617d74cdc90842420905132f1 9bd206c21eba456baa93913a159555ce
#: e913a0a7f90a4c379eb833f0d427802f
msgid ""
"Depends on your system, use `any method <https://blog.frd.mn/how-to-set-up-"
"proper-startstop-services-ubuntu-debian-mac-windows/>`__ to make the script "
"autorun at boot. In the steps below, we will use ``systemd`` to turn it into"
" a service."
msgstr ""
"根据您的系统，使用 `任意方法 <https://blog.frd.mn/how-to-set-up-proper-startstop-"
"services-ubuntu-debian-mac-windows/>`__ 使脚本开机自启。以下步骤中，我们将使用 ``systemd`` "
"将其注册为服务。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-vio-tracking-camera.rst:307
#: 24b6d5c31eff4a54ae9be1153806597e 34a6453407084b37a6afd5152538d8ea
#: 39a54a4663da4b7cb5ea36dd4ec55c87 830f104b5f6c4eada8b18795497b0e91
#: f5754e177b9745b7b8b7f8c43a7c0a0b
msgid ""
"Let’s create a file ``/etc/systemd/system/t265.service`` with the following "
"content. Set your actual username after ``User=`` and set the proper path to"
" your ``t265.sh`` in ``ExecStart=``."
msgstr ""
"创建文件 ``/etc/systemd/system/t265.service``，内容如下。将 ``User=`` 后填入您的实际用户名，并在 "
"``ExecStart=`` 中设置正确的 ``t265.sh`` 路径。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-vio-tracking-camera.rst:329
#: 53e796336c204ef1a235ed48262e9d5b 9a798bebe8c343d48857833eea33534b
#: c043262bc4ff4f9eb80b6c3cfa779b64 c689c5a6e92d403c8eff1d5760bf41a4
#: d3725dce2e1d4de2b20969615c09bb64
msgid ""
"That’s it. We can now start the service and automatically get it to start on"
" boot:"
msgstr "就这些。现在可以启动服务并设置开机自启："

#: ../../source/docs/common-vio-tracking-camera.rst:338
#: 1b12e02af7584dfa865096679dc17010 20c579541c1740d0b9b65b689fc8ef3e
#: 386bee74341f448a8c356c50d5535b5a 50ca9b372fc84414aa187f87eeb3597d
#: b7a76ad1168b4a06b7486e918c607621
msgid "EKF3 Source Transitions with OpticalFlow"
msgstr "EKF3 源切换与光流"

#: ../../source/docs/common-vio-tracking-camera.rst:340
#: 21ea833c6c7c4ee8a217cdcd99c2f595 48da7320bb5e4109b55e22d0f64cf672
#: 92aa6b6eb6b147bf8b505f85bcfb1100 a54369b98e7b46358746efff11a2acbe
#: c58192a49feb400f8c08767d16e86839
msgid ""
"If switching between this and OpticalFlow is desired, see :ref:`extnav-"
"optiflow-transitions`"
msgstr "如需在本方案与光流之间切换，请参见 :ref:`extnav-optiflow-transitions`"

#: ../../source/docs/common-vio-tracking-camera.rst:12
#: 1d6c66aa8fb147ca9e27aa0881d71782 5ae4d4202abd45709cd41fb29614ff7c
#: b3511c0473be4274861c351d9312995a c7985def0a4c4247ab0fdcc9d5629eb7
msgid ""
"This article explains how to setup an `Intel Realsense T265 "
"<https://store.intelrealsense.com/buy-intel-realsense-tracking-"
"camera-t265.html?_ga=2.225595998.511560227.1566178471-459370638.1562639781>`__"
" for use with ArduPilot as a substitute for a GPS allowing position control "
"modes like Loiter, PosHold, RTL, Auto to work. This method uses a python "
"script running on an RPI companion computer to send position information to "
"ArduPilot without the use of `ROS <https://www.ros.org/>`__.  The `setup "
"using ROS is here <https://ardupilot.org/dev/docs/ros-vio-tracking-"
"camera.html>`__."
msgstr ""
"本文介绍如何设置 `Intel Realsense T265 <https://store.intelrealsense.com/buy-intel-"
"realsense-tracking-"
"camera-t265.html?_ga=2.225595998.511560227.1566178471-459370638.1562639781>`__，使其与"
" ArduPilot 配合作为 GPS 的替代方案，从而让 Loiter、PosHold、RTL、Auto 等位置控制模式可用。此方法在 RPI "
"伴随计算机上运行 python 脚本，向 ArduPilot 发送位置信息，无需使用 `ROS "
"<https://www.ros.org/>`__。`使用 ROS 的设置见此处 "
"<https://ardupilot.org/dev/docs/ros-vio-tracking-camera.html>`__。"
